{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<h2>童年回憶戰鬥陀螺變身腰帶！</h2>\n<p>誰說戰鬥陀螺只能用來對戰？潮牌UmbraRare近日推出全新「Belt of Beys」特色腰帶系列，將《戰鬥陀螺 鋼鐵奇兵》主角鋼銀河的經典陀螺「暴風天馬」實物化成腰帶扣，讓一眾陀螺迷與潮流玩家，都能把童年回憶戴在身上，走在街頭絕對回頭率極高。這款腰帶扣採用經典的透明藍色零件、紅金色天馬圖騰，配合金屬光澤外框，將陀螺的細節完整重現。\n</p>\n<h2>回頭率爆表!</h2>\n<p>除了單個陀螺的腰帶設計，品牌更推出扣上一排12個陀螺的腰帶和腰鏈，讓大家可以按照褲子的款式，自由配襯出不同造型。無論是低調的單陀螺款，還是誇張的12陀螺款，都能展現獨特的個人風格。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179577361577590622_11266038386b0954b05a9e6.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179577361577590622_11266038386b0954b05a9e6.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179577361800427145_4036213996b0954b26fda5.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179577361800427145_4036213996b0954b26fda5.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<blockquote><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/DgPM3ZXieqN/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</a></p></blockquote>\n<p>\n</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T10:23:55.659675+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":363,"images":2,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T10:00:20+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T10:17:24.622762+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T10:17:24.622762+00:00","content_hash":"2a57349eddc097b0b46f910ee49b6afe302e3a6ad039b61106843232acb50669","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}